      "id": "java-foundations-variable-names-c01",
      "type": "code",
      "prompt": "读取并trim一段文本。使用SourceVersion.isIdentifier并排除SourceVersion.isKeyword(text, RELEASE_17)，输出它是否是JDK17可用标识符形状。空文本为false；关键字、字面量true/false/null和单独下划线不允许；Unicode名称可由该API识别。本题不检查名称语义，也不覆盖所有上下文相关限制。",
      "starter_code": "import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport javax.lang.model.SourceVersion;\npublic class Main {\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        String text = new String(System.in.readAllBytes(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8).trim();\n        // 按题面完成本课操作与输出\n    }\n}\n",
      "visible_tests": [
        "输入 'score'，输出 'true\\n'，退出码 0。",
        "输入 '2score'，输出 'false\\n'，退出码 0。"
      ],
      "experience_points": 20,
      "private": {
        "reference_solution": "import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport javax.lang.model.SourceVersion;\npublic class Main {\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        String text = new String(System.in.readAllBytes(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8).trim();\n        boolean valid = SourceVersion.isIdentifier(text) && !SourceVersion.isKeyword(text, SourceVersion.RELEASE_17);\n        System.out.println(valid);\n    }\n}\n",
        "hidden_tests": [
          "覆盖真实主题边界，不使用未声明的特殊标记。",
          "校验输入、输出格式和退出码。"
